		doc /* Mapped in Week 8, modeled later: Mission and goals MGO-001 to MGO-005 (Week 9: requirement with a subject); Stakeholder need NEED-001 to NEED-008 (Week 9: requirement with stakeholder parameters, framing its concerns). */
